<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοήθ-εια</span></b> , ἡ (
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοάθοια</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			421.36
		</span></i>(<span class="entity">Thermon</span>)), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help, aid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.22
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τῷ λόγῳ πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					128c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὑπὲρ τῶν δικαίων β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					56.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοήθειαν ἔχειν πρὸς ὑγίειαν,
				πρὸς τὴν ἑκάστου ὑπερβολὴν μηχανᾶσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				651b1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				652a32
			</span></i>: nom.sg., as exclamation '<i>help!</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				13.8.5
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Gorg.
				<u>Pal.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.302
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1383a29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ πρὸς εὔπλοιαν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.46
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				27.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>medical aid, cure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνδυνος ἰσχυρότερος πάσης β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>force of auxiliaries</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ παρὰ Διονυσίου β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.1.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῶν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			: opp. regular forces, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				4.32
			</span></i>.</div>
